{
  "description": "Normal-distribution engine — draws the Gaussian bell curve on a math-canvas with the mean line and one-standard-deviation band marked; learners drag the mean and standard-deviation sliders and watch the curve shift and flatten while the peak height and 68% interval readouts update. Standalone by default; behind a lab router set matchMode and it renders only when MODE_SELECTED matches.",
